{
  "format": "mistudio.behaviour-verdict-cases/1",
  "$comment": "Owned by miWorkbench (ENH-006 G19); miServer vendors it byte-identically and runs every case through its own combiner. Each case is a definition fragment (candidate, members), one window's inputs and the verdict. Expectations are written by hand, never generated by either combiner.",
  "tolerance": {
    "value_abs": 1e-09
  },
  "rule": [
    "Inputs: members maps a detector digest to {fires, score} or null; an absent digest is null. rules is {match, veto, unknown} or null.",
    "rules side (only when candidate.rules): unknown = rules is null or rules.unknown; match = not unknown and rules.match; veto = not unknown and rules.veto and not match. Without candidate.rules the rule inputs are ignored and rules out is null.",
    "missing = members (definition order) whose input is null, or whose fires is null (verdict kinds) / whose score is null (score kinds).",
    "members_fired = members (definition order) whose input fires is true. members_vetoed = members_fired whose veto_applies is true, when veto holds.",
    "verdict kinds (any_of k=1, all_of k=n, k_of_n:k): value = count of members_fired, leaving out members_vetoed unless EVERY member's veto_applies is true (then the veto is applied to the whole blend below). base = value >= k.",
    "score kinds: if any member is missing, value = null and base = false; else z_j = (score_j - mean_j) / std_j in float64, stack value = (sum over j in member order of z_j * weights_j) + intercept, max value = max z_j, best_single value = z[member_index]; base = value >= threshold. A score kind needs every member's veto_applies true.",
    "union: final = match or (base and not (veto and every member's veto_applies is true)); without candidate.rules, final = base.",
    "fires = true when final (decided_by rule_match when match, else members); else null with decided_by members_missing when any member is missing; else false with decided_by vetoed when veto holds; else false with decided_by members.",
    "rules out = {match, veto, unknown} with match and veto null when unknown. Agreement: every field exact, value within tolerance.value_abs."
  ],
